01:15:36.479 --> 01:15:37.680
I...

1069
01:15:42.239 --> 01:15:44.239
I have something
important I need to tell you.

1070
01:15:45.199 --> 01:15:46.199
O... kay!

1071
01:15:57.800 --> 01:16:00.000
I had an affair with your
dad when we were in school.

1072
01:16:02.199 --> 01:16:03.199
I'm sorry.

1073
01:16:06.279 --> 01:16:08.640
Girl why you...
Are you kidding me?

1074
01:16:09.880 --> 01:16:11.279
I've known all these years.

1075
01:16:12.399 --> 01:16:14.760
Wait!!
Why are telling me this now?

1076
01:16:21.800 --> 01:16:23.399
Cos I've realized how...

1077
01:16:25.680 --> 01:16:27.439
How wrong that was of me.

1078
01:16:27.920 --> 01:16:30.600
How much of a crappy
friend I've been to you.

1079
01:16:34.319 --> 01:16:36.600
I just felt you needed to know the truth.

1080
01:16:37.920 --> 01:16:38.960
The truth?

1081
01:16:40.119 --> 01:16:42.760
Did you even for one second think about me?

1082
01:16:43.680 --> 01:16:46.680
You've been calling me your best
friend all these years and yet.

1083
01:16:49.600 --> 01:16:50.840
You know at first I was upset.

1084
01:16:51.880 --> 01:16:54.840
But then I've realized my dad
has chosen his ways.

1085
01:16:55.000 --> 01:16:57.600
And you can't teach an old dog new tricks.

1086
01:16:59.159 --> 01:17:01.520
You were just one of his side chicks.

1087
01:17:05.399 --> 01:17:07.399
Or do you think you were the only one?

1088
01:17:12.279 --> 01:17:15.279
Well. the only person I felt for
was my mum. I mean.

1089
01:17:16.079 --> 01:17:19.399
When I found out that even she knew and
didn't say anything about it

1090
01:17:19.800 --> 01:17:22.039
Because my dad always
provided for the family.

1091
01:17:22.960 --> 01:17:25.119
And gave her whatever she wanted.

1092
01:17:26.720 --> 01:17:30.119
I just figured. why was I taking panadol
for another persons headache.

1093
01:17:33.840 --> 01:17:35.199
Joan I'm sorry.

1094
01:17:38.760 --> 01:17:40.359
Here!

1095
01:17:44.600 --> 01:17:47.800
For what it's worth I really needed
money at the time.

1096
01:18:06.880 --> 01:18:09.319
After awhile I got my best friend back.

1097
01:18:10.600 --> 01:18:12.720
I started a new phase of healing.

1098
01:18:12.800 --> 01:18:14.000
And acceptance.

1099
01:18:26.680 --> 01:18:27.640
Oh my God!

1100
01:18:27.680 --> 01:18:29.536
These are the new collections
I was telling you about.

1101
01:18:29.560 --> 01:18:31.640
I love it. I love all their designs.

1102
01:18:31.720 --> 01:18:34.520
Hands down my favorite
Nigerian fashion brand. So classy!

1103
01:18:34.760 --> 01:18:36.440
- You are getting one for me.
- Sure thing.

1104
01:18:36.479 --> 01:18:38.055
When I come back from my training in
Milan.

1105
01:18:38.079 --> 01:18:41.039
I'm going to order one of these.

1106
01:18:41.119 --> 01:18:43.215
- Oh my God. they are so beautiful.
- Are you telling me?

1107
01:18:43.239 --> 01:18:44.600
I'm buying all.

1108
01:18:48.479 --> 01:18:50.055
That's the gold digger
I was telling you about.

1109
01:18:50.079 --> 01:18:52.455
If not for my intervention she would have
been my step mum by now.

1110
01:18:52.479 --> 01:18:53.840
- Kali?
- Yes. you know her?

1111
01:18:53.960 --> 01:18:56.095
Yes. how will you know
fashion and not know her?

1112
01:18:56.119 --> 01:18:59.119
She's one of the best
in the industry.

1113
01:18:59.199 --> 01:19:01.680
- What do you mean?
- She's the CEO of Africana.

1114
01:19:01.840 --> 01:19:03.319
Wait. be serious now!

1115
01:19:09.399 --> 01:19:10.399
See?

1116
01:19:10.800 --> 01:19:12.920
And all this while I've been thinking...

1117
01:19:13.000 --> 01:19:14.960
- Toke come and introduce me to her now.
- Noooo!

1118
01:19:15.000 --> 01:19:17.039
Please now. I always wanted to meet her.

1119
01:19:17.079 --> 01:19:18.800
And take a picture with her please.

1120
01:19:18.840 --> 01:19:21.399
Okay. this is going to be super awkward.

1121
01:19:25.600 --> 01:19:28.359
- Hi.
- Hey.

1122
01:19:28.479 --> 01:19:29.680
Hi Toke.

1123
01:19:30.159 --> 01:19:32.640
Hi. I'm sorry about everything.

1124
01:19:35.479 --> 01:19:37.479
It's okay.
It's okay.

1125
01:19:38.199 --> 01:19:40.399
I'm sure you had good reasons
to say what you said.

1126
01:19:40.479 --> 01:19:44.399
- Still. I'm sorry.
- Stop. don't be so hard on yourself.

1127
01:19:46.640 --> 01:19:49.800
You know what?
I think I may have something just for you.

1128
01:19:59.920 --> 01:20:00.920
Play now!

1129
01:20:01.560 --> 01:20:02.560
Is that?

1130
01:20:03.039 --> 01:20:03.960
It's hold on.

1131
01:20:04.000 --> 01:20:04.680
Right.

1132
01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:06.571
God I shouldn't be
telling you the answers.

1133
01:20:06.583 --> 01:20:07.320
Are you serious?

1134
01:20:07.880 --> 01:20:11.039
Don't worry God will
reward me for my kindness.

1135
01:20:13.079 --> 01:20:14.720
Just call him already.

1136
01:20:17.399 --> 01:20:20.175
Well. for once I actually do not
want my happiness.

1137
01:20:20.199 --> 01:20:22.880
- To depend on somebody else.
- For how long?

1138
01:20:23.359 --> 01:20:26.479
You've already beaten your record for time
spent without being boo'ed up.

1139
01:20:28.640 --> 01:20:30.199
Truth is that. I've lost his number.

1140
01:20:30.279 --> 01:20:32.520
- I don't have it anymore.
- Okay!

1141
01:20:32.680 --> 01:20:34.880
I'm serious. pick two.

1142
01:20:35.800 --> 01:20:36.800
See vex.

1143
01:20:39.640 --> 01:20:41.720
Pick another two cos your mouth is sharp.

1144
01:20:43.079 --> 01:20:44.079
God!

1145
01:20:50.319 --> 01:20:54.199
Does anyone else think about the whole
concept of finding someone?

1146
01:20:54.760 --> 01:20:56.680
Connecting with them.

1147
01:20:57.319 --> 01:20:58.880
Falling in love with them.

1148
01:21:01.479 --> 01:21:04.960
Sometimes. I can't help but think
about the unlikely odds.

1149
01:21:05.279 --> 01:21:07.520
For many coincidences that have to happen.

1150
01:21:07.600 --> 01:21:10.680
For two strangers
to realize that without each other.

1151
01:21:11.119 --> 01:21:12.920
They are lost forever.

1152
01:21:14.600 --> 01:21:18.239
And when it ends. it's still beautiful
because you know that deep down.

1153
01:21:18.800 --> 01:21:21.920
You have been
touched by something deep.

1154
01:21:22.159 --> 01:21:23.800
Deeper than your trauma.

1155
01:21:24.880 --> 01:21:26.359
Deeper than your healing.

1156
01:21:27.079 --> 01:21:29.680
And both your lives will
never be the same again.

1157
01:21:34.760 --> 01:21:35.800
Hi.

1158
01:21:37.800 --> 01:21:38.800
Hi.

1159
01:21:50.079 --> 01:21:51.800
I still wear it because I like you.

1160
01:21:56.439 --> 01:21:59.199
You know for the past
one month I've been...

1161
01:22:00.399 --> 01:22:02.079
Doing a lot of healing.

1162
01:22:05.399 --> 01:22:08.279
I've been facing my past
and answering questions.

1163
01:22:08.359 --> 01:22:12.000
That I've not ever dared to answer before.

1164
01:22:14.920 --> 01:22:17.239
And I realized that I've.

1165
01:22:18.399 --> 01:22:20.680
I hurt so many people in the past and...

1166
01:22:23.279 --> 01:22:26.359
The thought of finally loving someone and
then hurting them I just...

1167
01:22:26.720 --> 01:22:28.399
I couldn't do that to you.

1168
01:22:28.600 --> 01:22:30.399
I couldn't do that to my self.

1169
01:22:31.800 --> 01:22:33.160
I didn't even think I was capable.

1170
01:22:33.199 --> 01:22:37.640
Of giving you back the love
that you. that you give.

1171
01:22:42.960 --> 01:22:44.159
And that's why I ran.

1172
01:22:45.520 --> 01:22:46.840
I'm Sorry!

1173
01:22:57.960 --> 01:22:59.279
So where do we go now?

1174
01:23:03.760 --> 01:23:07.600
Kola always said that when love
is real. it would always find a way.

1175
01:23:08.439 --> 01:23:11.760
He had said a thousand beautiful
things to me that were right.

1176
01:23:11.920 --> 01:23:14.720
But this is the
one I'll always remember.
